 Azure services based on several inputs. This would enable meaningful insights on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":172518,"global_rank":419444},{"name":"kmussar/American_Time_Use_Survey","owner":"kmussar","html_url":"https://github.com/kmussar/American_Time_Use_Survey","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Analysis of the American Time Use Survey from the Bureau of Labor Statistics ","topics":[],"score":172518,"global_rank":419445},{"name":"vritant24/ProsePro","owner":"vritant24","html_url":"https://github.com/vritant24/ProsePro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Word Processor for Professional and Hobbyist writer, with inbuilt version control functionality","topics":[],"score":172518,"global_rank":419446},{"name":"alankjackson/VoterChallenge","owner":"alankjackson","html_url":"https://github.com/alankjackson/VoterChallenge","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Build list of po box voter reg addresses in republican areas","topics":[],"score":172518,"global_rank":419447},{"name":"mbmcc/PPP","owner":"mbmcc","html_url":"https://github.com/mbmcc/PPP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172518,"global_rank":419448},{"name":"enriched/typed-ramda","owner":"enriched","html_url":"https://github.com/enriched/typed-ramda","stars":0,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Type definitions for ramda http://ramdajs.com/","topics":[],"score":172513,"global_rank":419449},{"name":"shauvik/polyments","owner":"shauvik","html_url":"https://github.com/shauvik/polyments","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1